    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Passed with 3 mana available and Chains of Custody castable. Casting Chains of Custody on Pious Wayfarer to exile Black Cat would trigger constellation (+1/+1), give ward {2}, and set up Sage's Reverie next turn for 2 card draws and +2/+2. This establishes the aura synergy engine that the deck is built around.",
