    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Timed out during precombat main phase with important plays available. With 4 untapped lands and opponent's creatures all tapped, KimiK2 could have cast Infernal Idol (3 mana) to ramp toward the game-changing Massacre Wurm in hand (costs 3BBB), and/or used Savage Punch to have the indestructible Rhonas fight and kill an opponent's creature for free. Missing the Infernal Idol deployment delays Massacre Wurm by at least a turn.",
      "action_taken": "Timed out and passed priority, doing nothing in the precombat main phase.",
      "better_line": "Cast Infernal Idol for {3} (using Forest, Swamp, Thriving Grove) to accelerate toward casting Massacre Wurm. Could also use remaining Swamp to cast Savage Punch with Rhonas fighting an opponent's creature, though the mana doesn't quite work for both. At minimum, Infernal Idol should have been deployed.",
